---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Our Teacher | Padma Pura Foundation"
	description="Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche, teacher in the Nyingma tradition of Tibetan Buddhism."
>
	<section class="teacher-opening" aria-labelledby="teacher-heading">
		<header class="teacher-opening__heading">
			<p class="teacher-opening__label">Our Teacher</p>
			<h1 id="teacher-heading">Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche</h1>
		</header>

		<p class="teacher-opening__intro">
			Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche’s life has been devoted to the study, practice and transmission of the Dharma. His training and Dharma activity are rooted in the Nyingma tradition, in transmission lineages he has received and continues to transmit, and in practice cycles he has studied and practised.
		</p>

		<figure class="teacher-opening__portrait">
			<img
				src="/images/rinpoche/tenzin-samphel-reference.jpeg"
				alt="Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche"
				width="1430"
				height="2048"
			/>
		</figure>
	</section>

	<section class="biography" aria-labelledby="biography-heading">
		<h2 id="biography-heading">Biography</h2>
		<div class="biography__prose">
			<p>Born in 1961 in Spiti, in the Indian Himalayas, Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche began his monastic studies at Kyabjé Dudjom Rinpoche’s monastery in Orissa, India. He later spent twelve years studying and practising at Urgyen Dongak Chöling, Dudjom Rinpoche’s monastery in Boudhanath, Kathmandu, Nepal. He subsequently taught Buddhism and philosophy at the same monastery under the guidance of Khetsun Sangpo Rinpoche.</p>
			<p>In 1987, at the request of Dudjom Rinpoche, Rinpoche moved to France to continue his Dharma activity there as a lama and teacher.</p>
			<p>In 1999, with the advice and encouragement of Khetsun Sangpo Rinpoche, Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche established Shedup Kunsang Chöling in France. Following a traditional ritual ceremony, Khetsun Sangpo Rinpoche enthroned him as a lineage holder and entrusted him with spiritual authority at the centre. Rinpoche has lived there since 2002, teaching and guiding practitioners.</p>
			<p>Rinpoche lives at Shedup Kunsang Chöling with his American wife, known to students as Khandro-la, and their four sons. His family life is an important part of the householder context in which he lives, practises and carries out his Dharma activity.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="training" aria-labelledby="training-heading">
		<div class="training__prose">
			<p>Throughout his training, Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche received teachings, empowerments and oral transmissions from many accomplished masters of the Nyingma tradition. Among his principal teachers were Kyabjé Dudjom Rinpoche, Dilgo Khyentse Rinpoche, Chadral Rinpoche and Khetsun Sangpo Rinpoche.</p>
			<p>Rinpoche holds and transmits several transmission lineages and practice cycles within the Nyingma tradition. Dudjom Tersar has a central place in many of the practices he transmits through empowerments, oral transmissions and teachings. He also holds transmission lineages of Yangti Nagpo and Longchen Nyingthig, among others.</p>
		</div>
		<h2 id="training-heading">Training and teachers</h2>
	</section>

	<section class="shedup" aria-labelledby="shedup-heading">
		<h2 id="shedup-heading">Shedup Kunsang Chöling</h2>
		<div class="shedup__prose">
			<p>Shedup Kunsang Chöling is a Buddhist centre in Septvaux, France, established by Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche in 1999 with the advice and encouragement of Khetsun Sangpo Rinpoche.</p>
			<p>It is an important centre for Rinpoche’s Dharma activity in France, where he gives teachings, empowerments and practice guidance and where students and practitioners gather for retreats, teachings and group practice.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<figure class="teacher-photo">
		<img
			src="/images/home/rinpoche-teaching-reference.webp"
			alt="Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche during a teaching"
			width="1366"
			height="768"
			loading="lazy"
		/>
	</figure>

	<section class="teaching" aria-labelledby="teaching-heading">
		<h2 id="teaching-heading">Teaching activity</h2>
		<div class="teaching__prose">
			<p>Rinpoche gives teachings, empowerments, oral transmissions and practice guidance, transmitting the Dharma according to the needs and circumstances of his students.</p>
			<p>His teaching activity is centred at Shedup Kunsang Chöling and extends through visits elsewhere, including his annual visits to the Netherlands. Padma Pura Foundation supports these visits and the related Dharma activities through which students receive his guidance and practise together.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="academic" aria-labelledby="academic-heading">
		<h2 id="academic-heading">Academic work</h2>
		<div class="academic__prose">
			<p>Alongside his Dharma activity, Rinpoche has also contributed to academic work relating to Tibetan language and Buddhist traditions.</p>
			<p>He taught for eight years at Inalco in Paris, where he also contributed to research in Tibetology. He has also worked with graduate students at Rice University in Houston.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="lineage-transition" aria-labelledby="lineage-transition-heading">
		<h2 id="lineage-transition-heading">Lineage &amp; Transmission</h2>
		<p>Learn more about the Nyingma tradition and the transmission lineages and practice cycles that form part of Rinpoche’s training and Dharma activity.</p>
		<p class="lineage-transition__link">
			<a href="/lineage">Explore Lineage &amp; Transmission</a>
		</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.teacher-opening {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(16rem, 0.65fr) minmax(14rem, 0.45fr);
		column-gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 5vw, var(--space-9));
		align-items: start;
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-block: clamp(var(--space-8), 9vw, 9rem) clamp(var(--space-9), 10vw, 10rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.teacher-opening__heading {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.teacher-opening__label {
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-5);
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.teacher-opening h1 {
		max-width: 9ch;
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 6.25rem);
		font-weight: 380;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		line-height: 0.98;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.teacher-opening__intro {
		max-width: 26rem;
		padding-top: clamp(var(--space-8), 8vw, 8rem);
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.teacher-opening__portrait {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 19rem;
		margin: 0;
		justify-self: end;
	}

	.teacher-opening__portrait img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	.biography {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr);
		gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 7vw, 8rem);
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-8), 8vw, 7.5rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.biography h2,
	.biography p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.biography h2 {
		padding-top: var(--space-2);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.biography__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.biography p {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.biography p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.training {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(0, 0.65fr);
		gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 7vw, 8rem);
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-8), 8vw, 7.5rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.training h2,
	.training p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.training h2 {
		padding-top: var(--space-2);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.training__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.training p {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.training p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.shedup {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-9), 10vw, 10rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.shedup h2 {
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-7);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.shedup__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.shedup__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.shedup__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.teacher-photo {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), 80rem);
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-9), 10vw, 10rem);
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.teacher-photo img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
	}

	.teaching {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-8), 8vw, 7.5rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.teaching h2 {
		max-width: 16ch;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-7);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 2.9375rem;
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.teaching__prose {
		max-width: 46rem;
	}

	.teaching__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.teaching__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.academic {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.65fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr);
		gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 7vw, 8rem);
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-8), 8vw, 7.5rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.academic h2,
	.academic p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.academic h2 {
		padding-top: var(--space-2);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.academic__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.academic p {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.academic p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.lineage-transition {
		max-width: 34rem;
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 6vw, var(--space-8));
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.lineage-transition h2 {
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-5);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 380;
		line-height: 1.2;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.lineage-transition p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.lineage-transition__link {
		margin-top: var(--space-5);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	@media (max-width: 48rem) {
		.teacher-opening {
			display: block;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-9);
		}

		.teacher-opening h1 {
			max-width: 10ch;
			font-size: clamp(3rem, 13vw, 4.5rem);
			line-height: 1;
		}

		.teacher-opening__intro {
			max-width: 30rem;
			padding-top: var(--space-7);
			font-size: var(--text-lg);
		}

		.teacher-opening__portrait {
			width: min(78%, 20rem);
			max-width: none;
			margin-top: var(--space-8);
		}

		.biography {
			display: block;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.biography h2 {
			padding: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		}

		.biography p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.training {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.training h2 {
			order: -1;
			padding: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		}

		.training p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.shedup {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.shedup h2 {
			margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		}

		.shedup__prose {
			max-width: none;
		}

		.shedup__prose p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.teacher-photo {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.teaching {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.teaching h2 {
			max-width: none;
			margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
			font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 2.5rem);
		}

		.teaching__prose {
			max-width: none;
		}

		.teaching__prose p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.academic {
			display: block;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.academic h2 {
			padding: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		}

		.academic p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.lineage-transition {
			max-width: none;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-7);
		}

		.lineage-transition p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}
	}
</style>